sequenceDiagram
    actor Listener
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Public as Built-in Catalog
    participant Private as SQLite Private Catalog
    participant Docs as Document Builder
    participant Search as TF-IDF Retriever
    participant Ground as Grounding Template

    Listener->>UI: Describe a vibe or moment
    UI->>API: POST bounded retrieval query
    API->>Public: Load approved built-in songs
    API->>Private: Load caller-owned private songs
    Public-->>API: Public records
    Private-->>API: Session-scoped records
    API->>Docs: Build derived song documents
    Docs->>Search: Caller-visible documents
    Search->>Search: Vectorize and score cosine relevance
    alt No positive relevance
        Search-->>UI: No candidates and safe guidance
    else Relevant records found
        Search->>Ground: Ranked canonical songs
        Ground->>Ground: Generate from catalog facts only
        Ground-->>UI: Candidates, scores, and evidence
    end
